{"results":[{"url":"https://www.realestatemumbai.com/3-bhk-flat-in-malad-west-for-sale-in-simplex-khush-aangan-9944009","title":"3 BHK for Sale in Simplex Khush Aangan | 1180 sq ft (#9944009) | Real Estate Mumbai","raw_content":"[![Real Estate Mumbai](/images/logo.png)](/)\n\n\n\nFor Sale\n\n![Simplex Khush Aangan — Malad West (1)](/thumb/800/building-properties/images/builders/projects/10009_main.jpg)\n\n₹ 5.5 Cr\n\n# 3 BHK for Sale in Simplex Khush Aangan | 1180 sq ft\n\n📍 SV Road,Next to Desai Hospital, Malad West\n\n📊 Avg 3 BHK sale in Malad West: **₹ 4 Cr** (97 similar)\n\n**3 BHK**Configuration\n\n**1180 sqft**Carpet area\n\n**₹ 46,610/sqft**Price per sq ft (carpet)\n\n**#9944009**Property ID\n\n**23 days ago**Listed\n\n**02 Sep 2026**Updated\n\nInterested in this property?\n\nConnect with our advisor — verified details, no spam.\n\n[💬 Enquire on WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919820075868?text=Hi%2C%20I%27m%20interested%20in%20the%20resale%203%20BHK%20at%20Simplex%20Khush%20Aangan%20in%20SV%20Road%2CNext%20to%20Desai%20Hospital%2C%20Malad%20West.%20Please%20share%20the%20price%2C%20property%20details%20and%20availability.%0A%0AReference%3A%20Property%20ID%209944009) [📞 Call +91 98200 75868](tel:+919820075868)\n\n## About this property\n\nThis 3 BHK apartment is available for sale in Simplex Khush Aangan, SV Road,Next to Desai Hospital, Malad West at ₹5.5 Cr. Carpet area is 1180 sq ft. That works out to about ₹46,610 per sq ft on carpet area. Details last verified on 02 Sep 2026.\n\nA 3 BHK home in Malad West, at Simplex Khush Aangan. The layout spans 1,180 sq.ft.. Priced at ₹5.50 Cr; enquire today.\n\n## About Simplex Khush Aangan\n\nSimplex Khush Aangan is a 17 storied Ready Possession Project and the location is SV Road,Next to Desai Hospital, Malad West and is developed by Simplex Realty Limited. Simplex Khush Aangan was launched in Simplex Khush Aangan is RERA approved has the Registration Number bearing. Simplex Khush Aangan is tagged as Investors Delight / Self Use. Simplex Realty Limited also has other under construction and ready possession and sold out projects like Simplex Khush Aangan. The property prices in Malad West are in the range of 13500 to 18500 for Outright for ready and under construction projects. Simplex Realty Limited currently has 1 Ready Possession projects. Simplex Khush Aangan has good reviews and the ratings of this project are approximately 3 out of 5. You can download the brochure of Simplex Khush Aangan and you can see the latest digital pictures, Floor Plans, Location Plans & Rate History on our website. The Bookings for the Ready Possession project Simplex Khush Aangan are open and we can set up a Site Visit any time at your Convenience.\n\n## About Malad West\n\nMalad West is a well-established residential and commercial suburb in the western corridor. Inorbit Mall, Mindspace IT Park, and the upcoming Metro Line 2A are key drivers of demand. It is connected to the rest of Mumbai via the Western Railway, Link Road, and S.V. Road. Strong demand from IT professionals, families, and young couples makes it one of the most active rental markets in the suburbs.\n\n## Location\n\n[🗺️ View on Google Maps](https://maps.google.com/maps?q=SV+Road,Next+to+Desai+Hospital,+Mumbai)\n\n## 📊 Property rates in Malad West\n\nApartments — buy**₹30,000–55,000/sqft**\n\n1 BHK — rent**₹30,000–50,000/mo**\n\n2 BHK — rent**₹55,000–1.05 Lac/mo**\n\n3 BHK — rent**₹85,000–1.25 Lac/mo**\n\nCommercial — lease**₹110–170/sqft**\n\n[See all Mumbai property rates →](/property-rates-in-mumbai)\n\nUpdated May 2026 · Real Estate Mumbai research\n\n## New projects in Malad West\n\n[View all →](/projects-in-malad-west)\n\n[![ Advent Deepak](/thumb/480/projects/33280/12.webp) Project](/advent-deepak-malad-west-project-33280)\n\n₹ 32,126/sqft\n\n [Advent Deepak](/advent-deepak-malad-west-project-33280)\n\n📍 Malad West · Advent Developers\n\n[![Narang Vivenda](/thumb/480/projects/31135/main.webp) Project](/narang-vivenda-malad-west-pr