nder the pincode of 400095.Chandak Treesourus, Narang Vivenda, Mahindra Marina64, Yukti Anchorpoint Aviara, Ruparel Stardom are several nearby under-construction projects. Transcon Auris Serenity, Raj Infinia, K Raheja Interface Heights, Gurukrupa Marina Enclave, Transcon & Sheth Auris Bliss are completed residential societies available nearby.\n\n### Simplex KhushAangan Floor Plan\n\n| Unit Configuration | Unit Size |\n| --- | --- |\n| Simplex KhushAangan 2 BHK Flat | 830 Sq. Ft. |\n| Simplex KhushAangan 3 BHK Flat | 1380 Sq. Ft. |\n| Simplex KhushAangan 3 BHK Flat | 1180 Sq. Ft. |\n Floor plans are the perfect way to understand how the spaces/rooms of Simplex KhushAangan are structured and help provide a clear picture of the house layout. The various units in Simplex KhushAangan come in 3 different configurations and have 5 types of layouts. Spacious balconies and well-fitted bathrooms ensure a ventilated environment in these configurations. To get an idea of the space covered, layout and room sizes, browsing through the floor plan would help. MagicBricks lists various configurations of different residential units in Simplex KhushAangan.\n\n### Simplex KhushAangan Brochure\n\n To have a detailed look at the features of the marvelous Simplex KhushAangan project, download its all encompassing pdf. The brochure is accessible from the top right end of the page, under the link 'Download Brochure'To download the brochure of Simplex KhushAangan you need to provide details of your name, number and email address.\n\n### How is the Malad West Real Estate Market?\n\n As of the July 2026 quarter, the average pricing of multistorey apartments in Malad West is Rs. 22,130/sq. ft, and the overall property range extends from Rs. 16,853 to Rs. 27,408/sq. ft, suitable for a wide spectrum of buyers. Currently, residential rental yields in Malad West, Mumbai is approx 3.56%. According to 383 user feedback, Malad West shows a rating of 4.07/5.When it comes to shopping and entertainment